        },
        "content": "## 🎯 Dashboard Guide\n\n**API Overview** — Instance health, latency, throughput, error rate, hallucination count, cache hit rate, grounding score.\n\n**Pipeline Quality** — RAGAS metrics (faithfulness, relevancy, precision), healing success rate, critic verdict distribution.\n\n**Infrastructure** — CPU, memory, and network I/O per container (API, Ollama, Chroma, Postgres, Redis, Neo4j).\n\n**Security** — Auth failures (401/403/429), rate limiting events, prompt injection blocks.\n\n### Alert Thresholds\n| Metric | Warning | Critical |\n|--------|---------|----------|\n| P95 Latency | >3s | >10s |\n| Error Rate | >5% | >10% |\n| Grounding Score | <0.85 | <0.7 |\n| Cache Hit Rate | <10% | <5% |\n| Memory (Ollama) | >85% | >95% |\n\n> **Tip:** Set the dashboard refresh to 15s for real-time monitoring.",
